timescale: --troeValueIndexes: 'speed' is not an IRI - the option takes attributes and entity types expanded (the core @context's: https://uri.etsi.org/ngsi-ld/default-context/speed)


--TEARDOWN--
coraineStop
corDbDrop
corTroeDrop
